<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Santos year net profit rises sharply.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Santos year net profit rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    331.9 vs 241.0</p>
<p>    Net				     195.9 vs 110.6</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     13.0 vs 12.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Santos Ltd is an oil and gas producer.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     24.0 vs 23.0</p>
<p>    Sales				   729.2 vs 671.6</p>
<p>    Other income			   85.3 vs 79.7</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    36.5 vs 26.0</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date May 2</p>
<p>Reg date April 11</p>
<p>    Tax				     136.0 vs 130.4</p>
<p>    Interest				 50.3 vs 44.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  191.6 vs 195.4</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
